    friendship: `Friendship brings respect for professional discipline, shared commitment to meaningful achievement, and relationships where competence and responsibility are valued. Thrives when professional respect is mutual, when ambition is understood and supported, when this person's serious career focus is appreciated.`,
    romantic: `In romance, brings serious partnership that supports mutual achievement, attraction to professionally ambitious partners, and relationships where career and public contribution are respected. Values partners who are professionally serious, supports partner's career through patient reliable commitment, builds life that honors both people's professional work. Challenge is allowing career to dominate or measuring relationship through professional status. Partnerships support mutual achievement patiently, respect professional commitments, build lasting life together through sustained work.`,
    feed: `Saturn moving through 10th house, its natural domain. Discipline at full strength focused on career, achievement, public contribution. Time for building lasting professional success through patient sustained effort, for earning genuine authority through competence.`,
    sonic: `Saturn in 10th contributes authoritative, disciplined quality at full strength. Music is professionally structured with measured commanding phrases, rhythm is controlled and authoritative, harmony is austere but creates lasting achievement through discipline.`,
